msgid "Packaging Klipper"
msgstr "Klipper paketieren"

#: docs/Packaging.md:block 10 (paragraph)
msgid ""
"klipper-git is packaged for Arch Linux, and has a PKGBUILD (package build "
"script) available at [Arch User "
"Repository](https://aur.archlinux.org/cgit/aur.git/tree/PKGBUILD?h=klipper-"
"git)."
msgstr ""
"klipper-git ist für Arch Linux paketiert und verfügt über ein PKGBUILD "
"(Paket-Build-Skript), das im [Arch User Repository](https://"
"aur.archlinux.org/cgit/aur.git/tree/PKGBUILD?h=klipper-git) verfügbar ist."

